      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "18+ could also be a nice shade of magenta. It doesn't have to be purple imho.\n\nUnder-18-verified should be deep red. *giggle* (when user is reported enough for immature behavior)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
