  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-12-07T03:23:38.004Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "At present the 18+ Age Verified is a deep red. It falls outside of the existing design language VRC has established to communicate who is trustworthy. The deep red gives a dark/negative impression as if the user belongs with the ranks of \"menace\" users, trolls, or even has an atmosphere of NSFW ready... I propose the following to better align the tag to existing standards:\n\nAge Unverified is white (similar to visitor)\n\nAge Verified is green (similar to user)\n\nAge Verified 18+ is purple (similar to trusted)",
